---
import Article from '../../research/dflash-muse-spark-1-2.md';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const pageTitle = 'DFlash explained: how block-diffusion drafting makes LLMs generate faster';
const description = 'A visual introduction to DFlash’s architecture, why it maps well to Apple M-series and NVIDIA RTX GPUs, and what a Muse Spark integration would require.';
const hero = '/images/research/dflash/dflash-muse-spark-hero.jpg';
---

<Layout title={`${pageTitle} · Latentsig AI Research`} description={description}>
  <div class="reading-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span id="progress-bar"></span></div>
  <div class="research-page">
    <header class="hero">
      <img src={hero} alt="Sequential token blocks flowing through a verification gate into a parallel block of sixteen draft tokens" width="1672" height="941" loading="eager" />
      <div class="hero-wash"></div>
      <div class="hero-grid"></div>
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <a href="/insights/" class="back-link"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Insights</a>
        <div class="eyebrow-row"><span class="eyebrow">Systems explainer</span><span>13 min read</span></div>
        <h1>DFlash explained: <em>faster tokens through parallel drafting</em></h1>
        <p>{description}</p>
        <div class="author-row"><span class="author-mark">λ</span><span><strong>Latentsig AI Research</strong><small>August 2026 · Paper walkthrough</small></span></div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="signal-strip" aria-label="Article summary">
      <div><span>01</span><strong>Draft a masked block in parallel.</strong><small>One diffusion pass replaces a serial chain of draft-model calls.</small></div>
      <div><span>02</span><strong>Inject the target’s own context.</strong><small>Five target layers become persistent keys and values in every draft layer.</small></div>
      <div><span>03</span><strong>Verify before committing.</strong><small>The target accepts a correct prefix; rejected candidates never become output.</small></div>
    </section>

    <div class="page-grid">
      <aside class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
        <span>On this page</span>
        <a href="#start-with-ordinary-speculative-decoding">Speculative decoding</a>
        <a href="#what-diffusion-means-for-text">Block diffusion</a>
        <a href="#the-dflash-architecture-layer-by-layer">Architecture</a>
        <a href="#how-the-drafter-is-trained">Training</a>
        <a href="#why-this-is-faster-on-apple-m-series-chips">Apple Silicon</a>
        <a href="#why-this-is-faster-on-nvidia-rtx-gpus">NVIDIA RTX</a>
        <a href="#how-dflash-could-work-with-muse-spark">Muse Spark</a>
        <a href="#the-benchmark-that-decides-whether-it-works">Benchmark</a>
        <a href="#sources">Sources</a>
      </aside>
      <article class="article-body"><Article /></article>
    </div>

    <section class="closing">
      <span>Latentsig AI Systems</span>
      <h2>Benchmark the speedup. Preserve the model.</h2>
      <p>We help teams turn new model research into measured, production-ready inference systems.</p>
      <a href="/contact">Design an inference benchmark <span>↗</span></a>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script>
    const updateProgress = () => {
      const article = document.querySelector('.article-body');
      const bar = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#progress-bar');
      if (!article || !bar) return;
      const rect = article.getBoundingClientRect();
      const total = article.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;
      const read = Math.min(Math.max(-rect.top, 0), total);
      bar.style.width = `${total > 0 ? (read / total) * 100 : 0}%`;
    };
    updateProgress();
    addEventListener('scroll', updateProgress, { passive: true });
  </script>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  :root{--bg:#08101f;--surface:#0d1729;--surface-2:#121d32;--line:#273149;--ink:#e8edff;--muted:#a6aec5;--violet:#a9abff;--violet-2:#7c80ff;--cyan:#86d2ff;--amber:#ffb783;--serif:"Hanken Grotesk",sans-serif;--body:"Geist",sans-serif;--mono:"DM Mono",monospace}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;background:var(--bg)}body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.72 var(--body);text-rendering:optimizeLegibility}a{color:inherit}::selection{background:#8083ff;color:#090f20}
  .reading-progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:2px;z-index:1000}.reading-progress span{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cyan),var(--violet-2),var(--amber))}
  .hero{min-height:710px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.hero>img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;filter:saturate(.9) contrast(1.03)}.hero-wash{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#08101f 0%,rgba(8,16,31,.96) 30%,rgba(8,16,31,.52) 65%,rgba(8,16,31,.15)),linear-gradient(0deg,#08101f 0%,transparent 48%)}.hero-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(160,170,200,.04) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(160,170,200,.04) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:40px 40px;mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#000,transparent 75%)}.hero-inner{width:min(1280px,100%);margin:auto;padding:80px clamp(22px,5vw,72px) 88px;position:relative}.back-link{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:28px;color:#bac3d8;text-decoration:none;font:500 13px/1 var(--body)}.back-link:hover{color:var(--violet)}.eyebrow-row{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-bottom:24px;font:500 10px/1 var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--muted)}.eyebrow{color:var(--violet);border-left:2px solid var(--violet-2);padding-left:10px}.hero h1{font:600 clamp(46px,6vw,80px)/1.02 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0;max-width:1000px;text-wrap:balance}.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--violet)}.hero-inner>p{max-width:760px;margin:28px 0 34px;color:#c6cde0;font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,21px);line-height:1.55}.author-row{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center}.author-mark{width:40px;height:40px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(128,131,255,.16);border:1px solid rgba(128,131,255,.38);font:500 22px/1 var(--serif);color:var(--violet)}.author-row>span:last-child{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.author-row strong{font-size:14px}.author-row small{font:400 11px/1.5 var(--mono);color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
  .signal-strip{width:min(1280px,100%);margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);padding:0 clamp(22px,5vw,72px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.signal-strip>div{padding:34px 30px 36px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;grid-template-rows:auto auto;column-gap:10px}.signal-strip>div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:30px}.signal-strip span{grid-row:1/3;font:500 10px/1.3 var(--mono);color:var(--violet)}.signal-strip strong{font:600 15px/1.35 var(--serif)}.signal-strip small{font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}
  .page-grid{width:min(1280px,100%);margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,790px) 1fr;gap:64px;padding:90px clamp(22px,5vw,72px) 120px}.toc{grid-column:1;align-self:start;position:sticky;top:90px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.toc>span{font:500 10px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--violet);margin-bottom:14px}.toc>a{font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:#919bb5;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(39,49,73,.55)}.toc>a:hover{color:var(--ink)}.article-body{grid-column:2;min-width:0}.article-body>h1:first-of-type{display:none}.article-body>p:first-of-type{font-size:22px;line-height:1.58;color:#d5dbef;margin:0 0 32px}.article-body h2{font:600 37px/1.15 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:86px 0 25px;scroll-margin-top:90px}.article-body h3{font:600 24px/1.25 var(--serif);margin:48px 0 14px;color:#f0f2ff}.article-body p{color:#b9c1d5;margin:0 0 24px}.article-body strong{color:#f1f3ff;font-weight:600}.article-body a{color:var(--cyan);text-decoration-color:rgba(134,210,255,.32);text-underline-offset:3px}.article-body a:hover{text-decoration-color:var(--cyan)}.article-body ul,.article-body ol{padding-left:24px;margin:0 0 28px;color:#b9c1d5}.article-body li{padding-left:7px;margin:8px 0}.article-body li::marker{color:var(--violet)}.article-body hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:84px 0 0}.article-body pre{overflow-x:auto;margin:36px 0;padding:24px;border:1px solid #2b3852;border-radius:10px;background:#0b1527}.article-body code{font:400 12px/1.7 var(--mono);color:#c7e5ff}.article-body p code,.article-body li code{background:#121d32;border:1px solid #2a3750;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px}
  .truth-note,.gate-note{display:block;margin:38px 0;padding:23px 25px;border:1px solid rgba(128,131,255,.35);border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(128,131,255,.11),rgba(18,29,50,.5))}.truth-note strong{display:block;font:600 15px/1.3 var(--serif);color:var(--violet)}.truth-note p,.gate-note p{margin:8px 0 0!important;font-size:14px!important;line-height:1.58!important;color:#b8c2da!important}.gate-note{border-color:rgba(134,210,255,.35)}.gate-note small{display:block;color:var(--cyan);font:500 9px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.13em}.gate-note strong{display:block;font:600 19px/1.35 var(--serif);margin-top:12px}
  .concept-figure,.paper-figure{margin:48px 0 58px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#0b1527;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.figure-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:17px 21px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.figure-heading span{font:500 9px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--violet)}.figure-heading b{font:600 14px/1.35 var(--serif)}.concept-figure figcaption,.paper-figure figcaption{padding:15px 21px 18px;color:#929cb5;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}.paper-canvas{padding:25px;background:#f8fafc}.paper-canvas img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:auto}.paper-figure figcaption a{color:var(--cyan)}.compact-paper{max-width:560px}.compact-paper .paper-canvas img{max-width:390px}
  .decode-compare{padding:27px 23px 30px}.compare-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:13px}.compare-label+div+.compare-label{margin-top:31px}.compare-label small{font:500 8px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.11em;color:#818eaa}.compare-label strong{font:600 13px/1 var(--serif);color:#cfd5e8}.pass-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 18px 1fr 18px 1fr 18px 1fr;align-items:center}.pass-row>b,.block-row>b{font-weight:400;color:#56637f;text-align:center}.pass-row span,.masked-block span,.verify-block span{min-width:0;padding:12px 7px;border:1px solid #33415d;border-radius:6px;background:#101c31;text-align:center;font:500 11px/1.25 var(--mono);color:#c5cee1}.pass-row span i,.masked-block>i,.verify-block>i{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;color:#76839e;font:400 7px/1 var(--mono);font-style:normal;text-transform:uppercase}.block-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 24px 1fr;align-items:center}.masked-block,.verify-block{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:4px;padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(128,131,255,.42);border-radius:8px;background:rgba(128,131,255,.07)}.masked-block>i,.verify-block>i{grid-column:1/-1;margin-bottom:5px}.masked-block span{border-color:#4a518b;background:#1a2542;color:#d1d2ff}.verify-block{border-color:rgba(134,210,255,.42);background:rgba(134,210,255,.06)}.verify-block span{color:#9cdfd0;border-color:#315967;background:#112a34}
  .equation-card{margin:38px 0;padding:25px 26px;border-left:2px solid var(--cyan);background:#0e1a2e}.equation-card>span{display:block;font:500 8px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7f8ba6}.equation-card>strong{display:block;margin:16px 0 11px;font:500 clamp(20px,3vw,29px)/1.2 var(--mono);color:#d8e9ff;letter-spacing:-.03em}.equation-card p{font-size:13px!important;margin:0!important;color:#919db8!important}.equation-card p b{color:var(--cyan)}
  .feature-fusion{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 30px 1fr 30px 1fr;align-items:center;margin:38px 0;padding:24px;border:1px solid #2c3953;border-radius:10px;background:#0d182b}.feature-fusion>b{color:#5d6984;text-align:center;font-weight:400}.layer-stack{display:flex;gap:4px}.layer-stack span{flex:1;padding:18px 3px;border:1px solid #365166;border-radius:5px;background:#112737;text-align:center;font:500 9px/1 var(--mono);color:var(--cyan)}.fusion-node,.context-node{min-height:78px;padding:14px;border:1px solid #3c4967;border-radius:7px;background:#111d32;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.fusion-node small,.context-node small{font:500 8px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:#7d8aa6}.fusion-node strong,.context-node strong{font:600 14px/1.25 var(--serif);margin-top:9px}.context-node{border-color:rgba(128,131,255,.62);background:rgba(128,131,255,.11)}.context-node strong{color:#c7c8ff}
  .kv-diagram{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 55px 1fr;align-items:stretch;margin:39px 0;padding:24px;border:1px solid #2c3953;border-radius:10px;background:#0d182b}.kv-source{align-self:center;padding:17px;border:1px solid rgba(134,210,255,.48);border-radius:8px;background:rgba(134,210,255,.07)}.kv-source small{font:500 8px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--cyan)}.kv-source strong{display:block;margin:12px 0 5px;font:600 16px/1.2 var(--serif)}.kv-source span{font:400 9px/1.3 var(--mono);color:#8290ac}.kv-bus{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-around}.kv-bus i{height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cyan),#4a5674);position:relative}.kv-bus i:after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-1px;top:-3px;border-left:5px solid #4a5674;border-top:3px solid transparent;border-bottom:3px solid transparent}.draft-layers{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}.draft-layers span{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid #34415d;border-radius:6px;background:#111d31;font:500 11px/1 var(--mono);color:#bdc5d9}.draft-layers b{font-weight:500;color:var(--violet)}
  .acceptance-demo{margin:38px 0;padding:24px;border:1px solid #2c3953;border-radius:10px;background:#0d182b}.acceptance-demo>small{font:500 8px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8190ac}.acceptance-demo>div{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:16px 0}.acceptance-demo span{padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid #35425e;border-radius:6px;background:#111d31;font:500 11px/1 var(--mono);color:#afb8cd}.acceptance-demo span i{font-style:normal;margin-left:6px}.acceptance-demo .accepted{border-color:#345f60;background:#112a31;color:#a2ded0}.acceptance-demo .rejected{border-color:#835246;background:#2b1e23;color:#ffc0a3}.acceptance-demo .discarded{opacity:.38;text-decoration:line-through}.acceptance-demo p{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.5!important;margin:0!important;color:#8d99b3!important}
  .hardware-paths{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:11px;margin:38px 0}.hardware-paths>div{padding:23px 20px;border:1px solid #2d3a55;border-radius:9px;background:#0f1a2d}.hardware-paths>div:first-child{border-color:rgba(134,210,255,.36)}.hardware-paths>div:last-child{border-color:rgba(128,131,255,.44)}.hardware-paths small{font:500 8px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8492ad}.hardware-paths strong{display:block;margin:16px 0 9px;font:600 17px/1.25 var(--serif)}.hardware-paths p{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.55!important;margin:0 0 17px!important;color:#929eb8!important}.hardware-paths b{display:block;font:500 8px/1.4 var(--mono);color:var(--violet)}
  .muse-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 20px 1fr 20px 1fr 20px 1fr;align-items:stretch;padding:25px 20px}.muse-flow>div{padding:17px 14px;border:1px solid #33415c;border-radius:8px;background:#101b2f;min-height:148px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.muse-flow>b{display:grid;place-items:center;color:#586580;font-weight:400}.muse-flow small{font:500 7px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8390ab}.muse-flow strong{font:600 14px/1.25 var(--serif);margin:15px 0 7px}.muse-flow span{font-size:9px;line-height:1.45;color:#8996b1}.muse-flow .accent{border-color:rgba(128,131,255,.6);background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(128,131,255,.14),#101b2e)}.muse-flow .accent strong{color:#c7c8ff}
  .decode-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 24px 1fr 24px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:stretch;margin:46px 0}.decode-flow>div{padding:20px 18px;border:1px solid #2c3953;border-radius:9px;background:#0f1a2d;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:165px}.decode-flow>b{display:grid;place-items:center;color:#596785;font-weight:400}.decode-flow small{font:500 8px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8490aa}.decode-flow strong{font:600 16px/1.25 var(--serif);margin:16px 0 8px}.decode-flow span{font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;color:#929db7}.decode-flow .accent{border-color:rgba(128,131,255,.6);background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(128,131,255,.13),#101b2e)}.decode-flow .accent small,.decode-flow .accent strong{color:#c0c2ff}
  .target-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin:38px 0 42px}.target-grid>div{padding:23px 19px;border:1px solid #2c3953;border-radius:9px;background:#0f1a2d}.target-grid span{display:block;font:600 34px/1 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#9da6bf}.target-grid strong{display:block;font:600 14px/1.3 var(--serif);margin:16px 0 8px}.target-grid p{font-size:11px!important;line-height:1.5!important;margin:0!important;color:#8f9bb5!important}.target-grid .target-main{border-color:rgba(128,131,255,.62);background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(128,131,255,.16),#101b2e)}.target-grid .target-main span{color:var(--violet)}
  .closing{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:95px clamp(22px,5vw,72px);text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,rgba(128,131,255,.12),transparent 52%)}.closing>span{font:500 10px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--violet)}.closing h2{font:600 clamp(34px,5vw,57px)/1.1 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.035em;max-width:850px;margin:20px auto}.closing p{max-width:610px;margin:0 auto 34px;color:var(--muted)}.closing a{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:var(--violet-2);color:#090f20;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:8px}.closing a span{margin-left:8px}
  @media(max-width:960px){.page-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:60px}.toc{display:none}.article-body{grid-column:1}.signal-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr}.signal-strip>div+div{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:0}.hero{min-height:690px}.hero-wash{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#08101f 0%,rgba(8,16,31,.88) 60%,rgba(8,16,31,.3)),linear-gradient(0deg,#08101f 0%,transparent 55%)}}
  @media(max-width:640px){body{font-size:16px}.hero{min-height:720px}.hero-inner{padding-bottom:58px}.hero h1{font-size:43px}.hero-inner>p{font-size:17px}.signal-strip>div{padding:24px 0}.page-grid{padding-bottom:80px}.article-body h2{font-size:31px;margin-top:68px}.article-body h3{font-size:22px}.article-body>p:first-of-type{font-size:19px}.decode-flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.decode-flow>b{height:20px;transform:rotate(90deg)}.target-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.target-grid>div{min-height:145px}.pass-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pass-row>b{height:18px;transform:rotate(90deg)}.block-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.block-row>b{height:24px;transform:rotate(90deg)}.masked-block,.verify-block{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.feature-fusion{grid-template-columns:1fr}.feature-fusion>b{height:22px;transform:rotate(90deg)}.kv-diagram{grid-template-columns:1fr}.kv-bus{height:38px;flex-direction:row;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-around}.kv-bus i{height:38px;width:1px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--cyan),#4a5674)}.kv-bus i:after{right:-3px;top:auto;bottom:-1px;border-left:3px solid transparent;border-right:3px solid transparent;border-top:5px solid #4a5674;border-bottom:0}.hardware-paths{grid-template-columns:1fr}.muse-flow{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:16px}.muse-flow>b{height:23px;transform:rotate(90deg)}.paper-canvas{padding:12px;overflow-x:auto}.paper-figure:not(.compact-paper) .paper-canvas img{min-width:620px}.paper-figure:not(.compact-paper) .figure-heading,.paper-figure:not(.compact-paper) figcaption{position:sticky;left:0}.compact-paper .paper-canvas img{min-width:0}}
</style>
